","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":3.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":62,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1081852268255854592,"date":1546768655000,"rawContent":"@Reestorff @videnskabdk ...men hvis man ser p\u00e5 den f\u00f8rste kommentar, s\u00e5 er der grund til at tvivle: \"#MeToo er udsk\u00e6ldt, fordi enkelte personer bruger det, som et k\u00f8nsracistisk redskab, der g\u00e5r over gr\u00e6nsen for privatlivet\".","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":63,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1081865285173428225,"date":1546771758000,"rawContent":"@koefoed @dortetoft @Reestorff ...som m\u00e5ske ogs\u00e5 kan have et bud p\u00e5 #dkmedier's udbredte \"anti #metoo\" attitude, som du sp\u00f8rger ind til indledningsvist, Dorte. Det er helt bizart.","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":64,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1081874626752495616,"date":1546773985000,"rawContent":"@beritertmann @tokeriis @dortetoft S\u00e5 vidt jeg ved har @Reestorff ikke blot analyseret opslag p\u00e5 Facebook, men ogs\u00e5 de artikler, der linkes til hos de forskellige nyhedsmedier &amp; artiklerne skal adressere #MeToo f\u00f8r de udv\u00e6lges. Det kan hun nok selv uddybe \ud83d\ude0a","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":65,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1081881933955633152,"date":1546775728000,"rawContent":"@Reestorff @beritertmann @tokeriis @dortetoft Det var det jeg mente: du kan godt sige noget om hvordan #metoo d\u00e6kkes i medierne mere generelt, fordi du, groft sagt, har fulgt linket fra Facebook til artiklerne &amp; unders\u00f8gt hvordan de stemmer overens?","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":66,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1082690111911936001,"date":1546968412000,"rawContent":"Altid seje, kloge @Reestorff er i radioen &amp; taler enormt reflekteret om #metoo. Det er sv\u00e6rt ikke at blive helt stolt \u2764\ufe0f\nhttps:\/\/t.co\/MhyV1mvMPv","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":67,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1083482038215294976,"date":1547157222000,"rawContent":"Really interesting investigation of the implications of #MeToo in China. \/cc @Reestorff","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":68,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1086934883728048128,"date":1547980445000,"rawContent":"Ser @Reestorff om #MeToo i Presselogen &amp; er ualmindeligt uimponeret over de tre chefredakt\u00f8rer. Er ikke overrasket, men det er sv\u00e6rt at skabe en mere rummelig, demokratisk debatkultur, n\u00e5r #dkmedier n\u00e6gter ethvert ansvar for den sk\u00e6vvridning der foreg\u00e5r.","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":8.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":69,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1086937627406856192,"date":1547981099000,"rawContent":"Is\u00e6r chefredakt\u00f8reren p\u00e5 JP faldt helt igennem &amp; udviste en eklatant mangel p\u00e5 forst\u00e5else for #MeToo. Han var n\u00e6rmest bare personligt fort\u00f8rnet over at skulle forholde sig mere til emnet, \"for det har vi da snakket nok om\". Som om problemet s\u00e5 er forsvundet.","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":70,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1087036460874645504,"date":1548004663000,"rawContent":"Jeg kom lige i tanke om, at jeg for nylig talte med en ven fra USA om de samtaler han har med folk om #MeToo i hhv. USA &amp; DK. Derovre tages det (af mange) enormt seri\u00f8st, mens det her mest er noget, man griner af &amp; ikke rigtigt kan forholde sig til. Meget sigende.","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":10.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":71,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1088361049441685504,"date":1548320469000,"rawContent":"\"Presselogens skallesm\u00e6kkende mimoser om #Metoo\" - altid skarpe @dortetoft har skrevet en go' artikel om #Presselogen &amp; #dkmedier's, demokratiets vagthund, underlige modvilje mod at p\u00e5tage sig et ansvar for den demokratiske samtale. https:\/\/t.co\/VYXiuRtDPy","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":72,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":1090605600222908416,"date":1548855612000,"rawContent":"\"F\u00e5 nu \u00f8je p\u00e5 magtens elefant\" - mere velfortjent kritik af #dkmedier's problematiske d\u00e6kning af #MeToo. https:\/\/t.co\/6DxjyAVZaX \/ping @Reestorff","userId":50262686,"media":null,"username":"mathiaspoulsen","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":73,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBla